description=Performance + GPU tweaks for POCO F7 (onyx). Forces full-res render (no GameManager downscale) + performance mode for Fortnite and other games, best-effort Fortnite pt-BR language, light I/O/VM tuning. Includes a WebUI control panel (KernelSU/APatch/MMRL) and a Magisk action button. Optional, off-by-default experimental 120fps model spoof.
